3471 0 obj
  << /ActualText (Architecture\072 A shared 3\055layer CNN encoder feeding into separate MLP heads \050256 \222 128 units\051 for the Actor and Critic\056 \n\nPolicy Network Learns distribution\nValue Network learns the expected return under a policy\n\nPolicy Updates\072 \nUsing log probability for calculus convenience\nGrad weighted with Advantage \050only updates with surprise\051\nCalculate advantage comparing current policy vs value head\nExpectation \050as we are training in batches\051\n\nIssues\072 \nLots of car spinning\nJerky Movement\nIncorrect progress tracking \n\nTo address this\054 we manually added penalties and safeguards to the reward function\072\nYaw\055rate penalty\072 punished excessive spinning\nNo\055progress termination\072 ended episodes when the car stopped making forward progress\nProgress Reward\072  Car rewarded for reaching end goal in fastest time\054 rather than incrementally\056 \n\n\n\n)
     /K [ 1 ]
     /P 3472 0 R
     /Pg 614 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

