3557 0 obj
  << /ActualText (What is a world model \050WM\051\056 \n\nRather than predicting the next word \050like LLM\031s\051\054  WM\031s try to  predict the next moment in reality\056 It learns the \047rules of the game\047\056 How physics works\054 where the walls are\054 and what happens when you turn the steering wheel \050through some guided trial and error\051\n\n\nThe model learns to \034dream\035 what the next best state might be\056 The edge comes from utilising actor\055critic training in this \034dream\035 state \050which is nothing but a neural net\051\056 \n\n\n This allows us to train racing strategies thousands of times faster than real\055time\054 bypassing the hardware bottlenecks that usually slow down AI development\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 3558 0 R
     /Pg 2722 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

